# Desktop sample. Run `haxe build.hxml` from this folder.
#
# Unzip Discord's C++ Social SDK into lib/discord_social_sdk at the repository
# root (see README, "Where the SDK files go"); the path below is relative to this
# folder. Point discord_sdk_root somewhere else if you keep the SDK outside the
# repo, and prefer an absolute path so it does not depend on the cwd.
-cp ../../src
-cp .
-main Main
-cpp ../../build/RichPresence
-D discord_sdk_root=../../lib/discord_social_sdk
-D HXCPP_NO_CPP11
